  "id": "speech-rehabilitation",
  "term": "speech rehabilitation",
  "definition": "Speech rehabilitation is an approach to helping a child develop speech-related abilities, such as speech perception and phonological skills. In this source, it refers to different communication-focused methods used with children who have cochlear implants, including multisensory and hearing-focused approaches.",
